y and demanding accountability has been central to your career, and this leans fully into that. As you prepare for the final night of the campaign, you think about the pushback, the investigations, and the long fight to keep government honest. It feels risky, but it is the clearest stand you can take and the one the country needs to hear.\"}}]");

